        <p class="mt-4">
          Establishing bot management forms an essential pillar of modern <a href="/ai-web-infrastructure/">AI Web Infrastructure</a>. Mastering how to block AI crawlers through balanced robots.txt Disallow rules, selective allowances for GPTBot, ClaudeBot, and Google-Extended, and enforceable Cloudflare WAF and NGINX 403 blocks maintains control over content distribution while keeping training scrapers separated from AI search bots.
